    "created_at": "2016-11-22T04:06:56Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-11-22T04:06:56Z",
    "body": "I think it's worth trying though it might result in making the interface almost the same as direct use of a raw ReadableStream and WritableStream which may look useless.\r\n\r\nI think this wouldn't block ship of `pipeTo()` and `pipeThrough()`. I hope this could be done in parallel with a relatively less priority.",
